WEBVTT

00:05:58.888 --> 00:06:00.956
and providing the ability 
for the students

00:06:00.956 --> 00:06:04.928
to do their postgraduate
into hosting research institute

00:06:04.928 --> 00:06:07.689
focusing on key challenges of the region,

00:06:07.689 --> 00:06:10.839
moving into the Science &amp; Technology Park

00:06:10.839 --> 00:06:13.119
and the innovation and entrepreneurship,

00:06:13.119 --> 00:06:17.939
which are really a very important 
elements of taking ideas into action

00:06:17.939 --> 00:06:21.638
and into really changing 
the way the economy functions

00:06:21.638 --> 00:06:23.692
by encouraging more and more startups.

00:06:23.692 --> 00:06:28.672
So, if you take a look at Education City,
you will find that City really encompasses

00:06:28.672 --> 00:06:33.616
all those, if you would like, factors
of really building the future